  "rationale": "Claim A reports a positive association between duration of metformin use and vitamin B12 deficiency (OR 1.01, 95% CI 1.00-1.02) in Vietnamese T2D patients, while claim B reports an explicit no-relationship finding for daily metformin dose and vitamin B12 deficiency. The exposures differ (duration of use vs daily dose), so the two findings do not concern the same exposure-contrast and cannot be meaningfully compared; the dose finding in B does not replicate or contradict the duration finding in A."
